    "why": [
      "21 neighbouring parameter settings all pass at 1bp, and walk-forward rank correlation is 0.83",
      "but the level ranges 40-50% across those neighbours, i.e. +/-5pp",
      "the first-30-minute add-on that lifts V2 above V1 is era-dependent (+5.3% / +26.3% / -0.3%)",
      "the 2% hysteresis band is worth ~8pp of CAGR and rests on ~5 discrete regime episodes",
      "the strategy is flat during session rallies, so a decade with intraday drift would break it",
      "cost sensitivity is severe: 6.3pp/yr at 1bp, and the CAGR bar is missed at 3bp and 5bp"
    ],
